1. block scope
  begin a
  begin b
  (end of block)
  end   b
  end   a
2. a temporary lives until the end of the full expression
  length   begin temp
4
  end   temp
3. binding a temporary to a const reference extends its life
  begin kept
  still alive: kept
  end   kept
4. members
  begin table.first
  begin table.second
  end   table.second
  end   table.first
5. done
